  "title": "Open Art Space",
  "summary": "Are you looking for a place to pace and perfect your artistic and creative ideas? Join us at the Open Artistic Space, where you have the limitless freedom to create! This space is a place of inspiration where you will be welcomed to create the artworks that you have always wanted to bring alive, or you can start a new project spontaneously. By attending our meetings, you will find a community dedicated to discussing art and meet fellow artists and art finatics who share your passion. What are you waiting for? Come share your creativity where you are welcome to use a plethora of our art materials &mdash; or bring your own tools! At the Open Artistic Space, the possibilities of creativity are",
